      ],
      "text": "Test 3\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        46.06962966918945,
        68.74456024169922,
        123.0346450805664,
        78.47206115722656
      ],
      "text": "Questions 1—7\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        46.06962966918945,
        95.37857055664062,
        454.9376220703125,
        105.82666015625
      ],
      "text": "Do the following statements agree with the information given in Reading Passage 1?\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        45.709712982177734,
        120.93283081054688,
        245.3297576904297,
        131.38092041015625
      ],
      "text": "In boxes 1-7 on your answer sheet, write\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        82.42144775390625,
        146.84693908691406,
        362.02099609375,
        181.0475311279297
      ],
      "text": "TRUE\nif the statement agrees with the information\nFALSE\nif the statement contradicts the information\nNOT GIVEN\nif there is no information on this\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        46.06962966918945,
        198.3153533935547,
        463.1797180175781,
        223.5201416015625
      ],
      "text": "1\nArchaeological research had taken place on the island of Obi before the arrival of\nCeri Shipton and his colleagues.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        45.34979248046875,
        232.8675994873047,
        430.3839111328125,
        256.27239990234375
      ],
      "text": "2\nAtthe Kelo sites, the researchers found the first clam shell axes ever to be\ndiscovered in the region.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        45.709712982177734,
        265.9801330566406,
        352.3031005859375,
        276.42822265625
      ],
      "text": "3.\nThe size of Obi today is less than it was 18,000 years ago.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        45.34980773925781,
        286.1356201171875,
        469.9966125488281,
        309.540771484375
      ],
      "text": "4\n Achange in the climate around 11,700 years ago had a greater impact on Obi than\non the surrounding islands.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        45.7097282409668,
        319.2481384277344,
        473.6425476074219,
        342.6533203125
      ],
      "text": "5\nThe researchers believe there is\na connection between warmer, wetter weather and\na change in the material used to make axes.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        45.349822998046875,
        350.9210205078125,
        396.0549011230469,
        375.765869140625
      ],
      "text": "6 — Shipton’s team were surprised to find evidence of the Obi islanders’\nhunting practices.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        45.349822998046875,
        384.0335388183594,
        423.59765625,
        408.8783874511719
      ],
      "text": "7 —\nItis thought that the Kelo shelters were occupied continuously until about\n1,000 years ago.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        44.98988723754883,
        671.6088256835938,
        56.47130584716797,
        679.5349731445312
      ],
      "text": "64\n"
    }
